    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "How the south facade is built"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Every number on this page is produced at load by the same pure solver the app runs over its frozen facade specification (decisions.md, DEC-004). It is not a survey. Three kinds of numbers are kept apart by the type system and labelled here:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list",
      "items": [
        "Sourced — carries an attribution key into ATTRIBUTIONS.md (\"No line, no use\").",
        "Declared — a photo-derived working target registered in docs/artistic-license.md; checked against measured elevation drawings during Phase 1 and corrected in both places if the record differs.",
        "Derived — solver arithmetic over sourced and declared inputs (docs/design-facade-grammar.md); recomputed on every load, never registered."
      ]
    },
